  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">donut sugar leads you on a melt-in-your-mouth journey of sweet nostalgia, where golden twists meet a soft blanket of cinnamon-kissed confectioners’ sparkle. Whisk pure cane sugar with a hint of vanilla bean and a pinch of fragrant cardamom for a cheerful, rum-free lift until the crystals glisten like sunrise. Toss warm rings in this fragrant cloud and share the moment with laughter and sticky fingertips. Each bite crackles with playful crunch and soft, pillowy sweetness, promising new memories with every dusted swirl. Keep a jar of donut sugar on standby for fritters, churros, and weekend treats, and let your kitchen feel delightfully sugar-dusted.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-donut-sugar\">Why You’ll Love This donut sugar</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-donut-sugar\">How to Make Donut Sugar</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-donut-sugar\">Pro Tips for Making donut sugar</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-donut-sugar\">How to Serve this donut sugar</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-donut-sugar\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This donut sugar</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Transforms ordinary treats into extraordinary delights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect balance of sweetness that keeps you coming back for more.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile for baking, topping, or even coffee stirring.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Brings a nostalgic touch to every bite, reminding you of childhood treats.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to use and store, making your baking adventures a breeze.</li>